    {
      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "NorthTec Recon",
      "questDescription": "Jamal Rivers, SecOps Lead at NorthTec, asks you to triage a forwarded UWork-lookalike message and reports of similar mail. Preserve and escalate the evidence, investigate how public profile data may support targeting, separate observation from attribution, and recommend a proportionate layered response.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>Jamal Rivers:</b> You treated the messages as a targeted-phishing investigation without overstating who was behind them. NorthTec can now preserve related evidence, block confirmed indicators, improve mail defenses, and help staff recognize and report similar attempts.",
      "questCharacterID": "u01_jamal_rivers",
